            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I've tried some debug printing with `expr_textobject`, it does produce valid call:\r\n```\r\n<Cmd>lua MiniAi.select_textobject('i', '\\'', { search_method = 'cover_or_next', n_times = 1, reference_region = nil, operator_pending = true, vis_mode = \"v\" })<CR>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe strangest thing is - when I try to run this code manually - it actually works as expected, selecting what's needed, but performing seemingly the same with `yi'` results in error. I'm almost 100% sure it's not the issue with `mini.ai`, but I'm lost on where to look next",
