        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> my next step would probably be hooking up into neovide to see what's going on under the hood at this point. I'll let you know if anything comes up, at least just to satisfy the feeling of unveiling the mystery =)\r\n\r\nI'd say that coming up with a minimal and stable reproduction example would already be very helpful. Without any extra plugins and only using built-in functions. If it errors on Neovim and not in terminal raw Neovim, then open issue in Neovide. Otherwise - in Neovim itself. Probably there is no need to look into internals before that.",
